  #sol-item(1, "A", dense: true, pad: 4.57pt)[
    *Chapter 1.* Electrons are transferred from the wool to the polythene. The wool is left with an equal positive charge, so the pair stays neutral overall.
  ]

  #sol-item(2, "C", dense: true, pad: 4.57pt)[
    *Chapter 2.* Combining $P = I V$ with $V = I R$ gives $P = I^2 R$, and with $I = V\/R$ gives $P = V^2\/R$.
  ]
  ]

  #sol-item(3, "B", dense: true, pad: 4.57pt)[
