  ]

  #sol-item(5, "D", dense: true, pad: 4.57pt)[
    *Chapter 5.* $E_4 = -13.6\/16 = -0.85$ eV. The levels crowd together as $n$ increases.
  ]

  #sol-item(6, "A", dense: true, pad: 4.57pt)[
